          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the difference between Kisspeptin-10 and Gonadorelin?",
            "answer": "<p>Kisspeptin-10 is studied upstream of GnRH neurons, while Gonadorelin is synthetic GnRH studied directly at pituitary GnRH receptors. Both may relate to LH and FSH research, but they act at different levels and are not equivalents or substitutes. This is not a usage recommendation.</p>"
          }
        },
