            "answer": "<p>Kisspeptin-10 is studied through KISS1R, GnRH and reproductive-axis regulation. PT-141, or bremelanotide, is a melanocortin analogue studied in different central neural pathways related to motivation and sexual response. Their structures, receptors and research axes differ; this is not a usage recommendation.</p>"
